Error [E0112]: `volatile_write` needs a `Ptr<T>`, not Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/lowlevel_volatile_write_wrong_ptr.jet:5:28
    |
  5 |         mem.volatile_write(1, 2)
    |                            ^
 Why: a volatile write writes through a typed pointer
 Fix: build a pointer first with `mem.Ptr<T>.from_addr(addr)`
